{"id": "unknown-2026-11-22-007", "date": "2026-11-22", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 47, "weekday": "Sun"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["cathode_material", "industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Briggs & Stratton keeps the lights on longer with bigger 16 kWh LFP battery", "content": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://electrek.co/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/gary_dark.png?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For decades, Briggs &amp; Stratton has helped keep the lights on after the storm with its gas-powered generators. Now, the company is bringing that legacy to the electric age with a new 16 kWh backup battery designed to scale with your growing energy needs.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"battery-storage,home-battery,s", "sources": [{"name": "electrek", "url": "https://electrek.co/2026/11/22/briggs-stratton-keeps-the-lights-on-longer-with-bigger-16-kwh-lfp-battery/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-11-22-008", "date": "2026-11-22", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 47, "weekday": "Sun"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "From equipment to ferries to locomotives, Illinois ports are getting a ZEV makeover", "content": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://electrek.co/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2024/07/big-forklift.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Illinois Clean Ports Program is putting $104 million behind efforts to help clean up its working waterfronts, funds earmarked for heavy-duty electric equipment assets that includes forklifts, giant reach stackers, switcher locomotives, and the charging equipment needed to support them. There’s even a passenger f", "sources": [{"name": "electrek", "url": "https://electrek.co/2026/11/22/from-equipment-to-ferries-to-locomotives-illinois-ports-are-getting-a-zev-makeover/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "nio-2026-11-22-009", "date": "2026-11-22", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 47, "weekday": "Sun"}, "entities": {"companies": ["nio"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Nio Firefly debuts Haven special edition in Oslo, plans spring 2027 launch in Europe", "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cnevpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026112202055214.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" /></p><p>The vehicle is the first model in Firefly's design-driven Halo series, making its European debut in Oslo as Nio marks its fifth anniversary in Norway.</p>\n<p>For details, please visit <a href=\"https://cnevpost.com\">CnEVPost</a> (cnev.co).</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "cnevpost", "url": "https://cnevpost.com/2026/11/22/nio-firefly-debuts-haven-edition-oslo-spring-2027-launch-europe/", "type": "rss"}]}
